OL,3,GNEWSAFundraising appeal for woman who
OL,4,Alost house in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn online fundraising appeal has been
OL,7,Fset up for a 75-year-old woman who lost
OL,8,Feverything in a house fire.
OL,10,FMoira Deeprose from Quinton in
OL,11,FBirmingham said the first thing she
OL,12,Fknew about fire on 15 July was when a
OL,13,Fneighbour knocked her door down and she
OL,14,Fhad to flee in just her nightdress and
OL,15,Fslippers.
OL,17,FShe said "it ruined my life" and she is
OL,18,Fstill waiting for a permanent home to
OL,19,Fmove into.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
